        {
          "id": 717533416,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "[WSDG](https://www.wireshark.org/docs/wsdg_html/) - 12.2.4.5. Internationalization and Translation  \n  \n```\nEach week translations are automatically synchronized with the source code through the following steps:\n\nPull changes from Transifex by running tx pull -f.\nRun lupdate on the ts files.\nPush and commit on Gerrit.\nPush changes to Transifex by running tx push.\n```\nThis seems to indicate that the change process is bi-directional?",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Chuck Craft",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
